WEBVTT

00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:07.520
One Year Ago

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:15.320
Hey, Dad, I think I'm starting to understand now.

00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:21.250
This body was given to me by God to save everyone in the world...

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:23.000
That's what I think...

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:28.420
Right, that must be it.

00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:32.720
Gai...

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:38.470
Big Brother Gai...

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:46.480
I swear I'll bring you down even if it kills me, too!

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:50.110
Hell and Heaven!

00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:02.450
Don't do it, Big Brother Gai! That's not the real core!

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:12.460
What on earth is that?

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:17.300
No...

00:01:17.390 --> 00:01:18.470
No...

00:01:20.810 --> 00:01:24.850
Gai!

00:01:27.180 --> 00:01:30.180
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:30.180 --> 00:01:33.080
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:34.150 --> 00:01:40.070
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:40.430 --> 00:01:44.080
Rise in fury, Steel Cyborg!

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:50.800
With your red mane and golden arms!

00:01:52.120 --> 00:01:55.080
Your G-Stone sparkling in the sun...

00:01:55.080 --> 00:02:00.000
All the world's hope is in your hands.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:03.920
Your time has come to make a stand!

00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:06.720
Crushing the hopes of the people...

00:02:06.720 --> 00:02:10.480
The Zonders will pay the price!

00:02:12.630 --> 00:02:15.480
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:18.650
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:18.650 --> 00:02:21.190
Final Fusion, approved!

00:02:21.390 --> 00:02:24.320
Now transform into a superhero!

00:02:24.320 --> 00:02:27.280
Warping dimensional space!

00:02:27.530 --> 00:02:31.360
Dividing Driver!

00:02:33.180 --> 00:02:39.000
A miracle! A mystery! The truth! A dream!

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:44.880
A gigantic, invincible guardian is born!

00:02:44.880 --> 00:02:47.830
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:51.720
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:53.900
This is the story of the brave men and women...

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:56.860
...who fight with all their hearts to save mankind.

00:02:59.110 --> 00:02:59.150
The Right Arm Must Be Destroyed

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:01.860
<i>The Right Arm Must Be Destroyed</i>

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:29.020
Scores of micromachines, manipulated by ultra-short wave...

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:31.980
...frequencies transmitted by the Zonder host, have infested the...

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:34.770
...central nervous systems of the employees of SDC...

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:38.110
...including Mikoto, causing an outbreak of aberrant behavior.

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:52.750
All affected have been freed, thanks to the intervention of the Brave Robots.

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:56.420
...but now, the Zonder mass has transformed into an...

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:59.840
...earth-bound sun, emitting powerful rays.

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:03.680
A colossal mass of energy, the Grand Nova!

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:07.470
GaoGaiGar has been swallowed up by the Zonder sun, which is now...

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:09.890
...subjecting him to a constant barrage of explosions.

00:04:15.610 --> 00:04:19.780
Presently, the radius of the Grand Nova has stabilized at 526 meters.

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:22.030
Spectral analysis shows that...

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:24.910
...the temperature inside the Nova has reached 6,000 degrees.

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:27.780
How is the evacuation going?

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:31.620
The police and the Self-Defense Forces are getting everybody out.

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:33.830
They're on track to finish evacuating everyone in about 20 minutes.

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:38.040
Professor! What in the world is that Grand Nova?

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:41.670
It likely used the energy generated by Hell and Heaven as a detonator...

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:44.090
...and now all of the micromachines are beginning to...

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:45.840
...fuse their collective energy together.

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:48.550
It's like a miniature sun's been created...

00:04:48.890 --> 00:04:52.930
I have a feeling defeating GaoGaiGar isn't the enemy's only objective...

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:58.900
Inside the Nova, there are at least 2,000 violent explosions per minute!

00:05:00.690 --> 00:05:03.610
A splendid job, Pizza!

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:07.700
I don't see how even GaoGaiGar can withstand...

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:10.540
...those explosions and the intense heat.

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:15.710
We can just sit back and proceed to the second phase of our plan.

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:18.170
I'll be looking forward to that!

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:27.970
True to form, Pizza, an impeccable job!

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:30.010
But don't let down your guard yet.

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:32.470
That child still exists on this planet, remember.

00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:34.890
And it's highly likely that he'll try to get in our way!

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:38.230
Curatio!

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:40.730
I know...

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:43.150
Of course I know that, Penchinon...

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:45.240
Internal analysis completed...

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:47.280
I've located GaoGaiGar!

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:57.250
He's near the center of the Nova, still in one piece.

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:00.750
But there's still no response!

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:04.710
GaoGaiGar's armor can only withstand up to 5,000 degrees!

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:15.100
This is Hyuuma.

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:18.600
We've finished patching up HyoRyu, EnRyu, and Volfogg!

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:20.060
All right!

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:23.190
You are to extinguish the Grand Nova with the Eraser Head, immediately!

00:06:23.230 --> 00:06:24.280
Wait!

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:27.700
Even Hell and Heaven had no effect on those things.

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:29.530
How are we going to defeat them now?

00:06:30.070 --> 00:06:31.240
When the time comes...

00:06:33.280 --> 00:06:36.660
When the time comes, I shall approve the use of the G-Tool!

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:37.790
What?

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:40.880
Symmetrical Docking, approved!

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:46.550
Symmetrical Docking!

00:06:58.940 --> 00:07:03.650
ChoRyuJin!

00:07:03.980 --> 00:07:06.030
All right! Landing and Supply Assault Ship!

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:08.780
Eraser Head, launch!

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:11.320
Mamoru?

00:07:16.950 --> 00:07:20.330
Captain! Please hang on until I get there! I'm coming to rescue you now!

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:23.330
Eraser Head, launch!

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:39.680
Yay! We did it!

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:42.850
Oh, no!

00:07:43.060 --> 00:07:45.730
The Grand Nova is expanding again!

00:07:46.980 --> 00:07:49.280
What an enormous amount of energy!

00:07:49.650 --> 00:07:52.320
We have no choice but to keep firing until it's blasted away completely!

00:07:52.740 --> 00:07:55.620
All right! Eraser Head No. 2, launch!

00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:04.250
I'm coming back, no matter what. I promise you!

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:07.750
That's a promise, okay? Remember, you promised!

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:09.880
It's all my fault...

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:13.130
If only I'd forced him not to go, then Big Brother Gai...

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:17.220
Volfogg!

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:20.390
Special Agent Mamoru, it is too dangerous for you beyond this point.

00:08:20.390 --> 00:08:22.100
I can sense the Zonder!

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:24.690
The Zonder's controlling all the micromachines inside that light...

00:08:24.690 --> 00:08:26.440
There's nothing else inside it!

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:30.030
But as the electromagnetic waves are too intense in this area...

00:08:30.070 --> 00:08:31.900
I can't tell for sure unless I get near it!

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:34.740
We have no way of contacting anyone now.

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:37.910
Our best bet would be to return to the Main Order Room...

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:40.750
If we don't do something now, Big Brother Gai's going to die!

00:08:42.460 --> 00:08:45.670
Very well. Then let me accompany you.

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:49.670
Take this, Special Agent Mamoru.

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:50.880
What's this?

00:08:51.050 --> 00:08:55.180
Protection Kit No. 14, a heat-resistant suit made for you.

00:08:57.090 --> 00:08:58.680
Thanks, Volfogg!

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:00.430
Now then, let us fight together!

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:07.860
I've just detected an unidentified cavity in the center of the Grand Nova!

00:09:07.900 --> 00:09:08.860
What about GaoGaiGar?

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:13.440
He's outside the cavity, still standing silently...

00:09:13.740 --> 00:09:16.780
Eraser Head No. 4, launch!

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:49.270
Gai...

00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:52.940
I'm the one who killed you, Gai...

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:56.450
I'm the one who killed Gai!

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:05.910
Eraser Head No. 5, launch!

00:10:20.180 --> 00:10:21.510
Not done yet!

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:29.940
Such fools...

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:32.480
As if it were only a piddling amount of energy...

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:34.860
...that could be obliterated with an eraser!

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:36.530
So true, so very true...

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:38.070
The time is near...

00:10:38.150 --> 00:10:42.530
Soon, we'll raise a whole brood of lovely little Zonders, won't we?

00:10:44.990 --> 00:10:47.870
No. 7! Eraser Head L! Launch!

00:10:56.380 --> 00:11:02.050
Due to the effects of Eraser Head No. 7, Grand Nova has contracted 86%.

00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:05.010
However, we still can't stop it from re-expanding!

00:11:05.060 --> 00:11:06.890
Eraser Head No. 8...

00:11:07.020 --> 00:11:10.020
This time we're going to launch it from the Landing & Supply Assault Ship!

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:11.100
Curses!

00:11:11.190 --> 00:11:14.610
At this rate we'll lose ChoRyuJin before we can rescue GaoGaiGar!

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:17.070
I've detected traces of the Elementary Particle Z0...

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:19.530
...inside the cavity at the center of the Grand Nova.

00:11:19.570 --> 00:11:23.450
This elementary particle outbreak somehow seems familiar...

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:26.330
No! Professor!

00:11:26.870 --> 00:11:28.830
This is just like what happened on that day!

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:31.420
So that's what it is, eh?

00:11:38.340 --> 00:11:41.220
That's a Zonder Metal Plant!

00:11:54.270 --> 00:11:56.610
Listen, I've got to get going now...

00:11:57.070 --> 00:12:00.530
So you've found where it is you're supposed to go...

00:12:00.900 --> 00:12:02.910
Okay, see you later...

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:04.910
Oh! Wait a minute, Gai...

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:07.620
How could you forget this?

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:08.540
Here, take it.

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:09.290
Huh?

00:12:11.410 --> 00:12:14.120
So you'll never forget me!

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:16.880
You little idiot, I'd never forget you!

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:18.630
Huh?

00:12:20.510 --> 00:12:21.970
Am I...

00:12:22.590 --> 00:12:25.140
Am I dead now?

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:27.970
Galeon?

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:33.350
Where am I?

00:12:39.480 --> 00:12:44.070
Are the Micro-Zonders causing all these explosions?

00:12:45.530 --> 00:12:50.620
Galeon, if you hadn't thrown your Protect Shade barrier around me...

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:52.200
...I wouldn't be here now!

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:55.290
Even so, I can't...

00:12:59.590 --> 00:13:02.720
There's a Zonder Metal Plant in the center of that Grand Nova!

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:08.510
They used the particle accelerator, Isolde, for the same reason!

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:12.390
The micromachines are being used to create huge amounts of energy!

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:16.730
And they used Hell and Heaven as a detonating device!

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:18.190
We've got no time to lose!

00:13:18.230 --> 00:13:20.730
Or else they'll succeed in producing untold amounts of Zonder Metal!

00:13:21.030 --> 00:13:24.070
Eraser Head No. 8, now ready to be launched.

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:35.040
Are you saying the Zonder is in core form, unable to move on its own?

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:36.960
I think so.

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:40.540
I'll bet it's got its hands full, just creating that Grand Nova...

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:43.340
I've detected a Barrier System up ahead!

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:44.510
I'm taking it down...

00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:46.470
Melting Siren!

00:13:54.220 --> 00:13:55.520
Intruders!

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:58.060
They've actually broken through our barrier!

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:01.190
I'm willing to bet it's that purple robot...

00:14:03.730 --> 00:14:07.740
Galeon, I don't have much energy left.

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:10.120
This is my last gamble...

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:11.450
Please, help me out...

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:20.330
This is our last Eraser Head.

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:22.460
ChoRyuJin! That's enough, retreat at once!

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:24.590
You've got to get out of there, or you'll be in danger too!

00:14:24.760 --> 00:14:27.090
I'm not retreating until after I've launched this Eraser Head.

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:30.260
Eraser Head 2L!

00:14:30.300 --> 00:14:31.430
Launch!

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:40.190
Hyper Mode!

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:50.530
Captain!

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:01.170
Hey, guys! Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:03.840
GaoGaiGar has managed to escape!

00:15:04.750 --> 00:15:06.670
We've waiting for you, hero!

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:14.100
Captain, thank goodness you're safe!

00:15:14.100 --> 00:15:16.270
It's all thanks to you, ChoRyuJin!

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:21.520
Thanks for making me worry, you jerk!

00:15:21.650 --> 00:15:22.480
Gai!

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:23.810
Mikoto!

00:15:24.110 --> 00:15:26.150
Are you sure you're all right now, Utsugi?

00:15:26.190 --> 00:15:29.400
I can't just rest when everybody's out here fighting!

00:15:29.530 --> 00:15:31.740
Please, let me join the fight!

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:40.540
Here he comes!

00:15:52.590 --> 00:15:53.760
A mere trifle...

00:16:01.310 --> 00:16:03.350
Silver Moon!

00:16:07.690 --> 00:16:10.240
Silver Cross!

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:16.700
Resorting to cheap tricks!

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:28.550
GaoGaiGar, energy replenished to 120%!

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:32.220
ChoRyuJin, parts swapped!
20 minutes until he's warmed up!

00:16:36.180 --> 00:16:37.930
Chief! Please! Let me use it!

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:40.430
An enemy immune to Hell and Heaven...

00:16:40.470 --> 00:16:42.810
...the Grand Nova, which cannot be erased by the Eraser Head...

00:16:42.890 --> 00:16:45.940
...and a Zonder Metal Plant on the verge of being completed!

00:16:46.190 --> 00:16:47.810
Looks like we have no other choice!

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:49.360
All right!

00:16:49.570 --> 00:16:50.690
G-Tool!

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:52.610
Binding, release!

00:16:53.150 --> 00:16:54.400
Thought you'd never ask!

00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:56.160
Take your positions, everybody!

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:57.570
Let's start this operation!

00:17:15.430 --> 00:17:16.930
GunDober!

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:25.730
GunGlue!

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:35.700
Three Become One!

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:50.460
Big Volfogg!

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:55.420
Finishing move, Whirling Death Strike!

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:04.520
You're too slow!

00:18:07.440 --> 00:18:09.690
The Deadly Art of the Body-Split!

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:24.410
So this is the G-Tool!

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:25.830
Goldion Hammer!

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:31.790
Goldion Hammer...

00:18:31.880 --> 00:18:33.750
Activation, approved!

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:38.470
Roger!

00:18:38.510 --> 00:18:39.890
Goldion Hammer...

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:43.850
Safety Device, relieve!

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:50.770
You need to stay back, Pliers!

00:18:53.900 --> 00:18:59.990
The Goldion Hammer, official name: "Gravity Shockwave Generating Tool."

00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:01.700
Containing a...

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:05.660
...shockwave-generating gravity well, it is Earth's strongest invention!

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:14.040
Murasame Sword!

00:19:16.340 --> 00:19:16.880
How absurd!

00:19:24.350 --> 00:19:26.100
4,000 Magnum!

00:19:34.060 --> 00:19:36.730
Curses! So you were just a decoy!

00:19:36.820 --> 00:19:37.780
No!

00:19:39.490 --> 00:19:40.950
Don't you dare touch that core!

00:19:42.320 --> 00:19:43.410
Private Mamoru!

00:19:43.530 --> 00:19:45.740
Stop it, Pizza! That child is...

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:52.040
Goldion Hammer!

00:20:12.020 --> 00:20:13.980
Zonder!

00:20:14.900 --> 00:20:16.570
Zonder!

00:20:31.410 --> 00:20:32.830
Hooray!

00:20:32.910 --> 00:20:34.120
A smashing success!

00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:46.470
Pizza, it looks like our Zonder Metal Plant has been destroyed.

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:48.930
They've defeated us...

00:20:50.390 --> 00:20:51.980
I don't believe this!

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:55.600
Private Mamoru!

00:20:56.440 --> 00:20:57.860
You're not hurt, are you?

00:20:57.900 --> 00:20:58.940
No, I'm fine.

00:20:59.480 --> 00:21:01.440
But I'm starting to understand something...

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:04.150
...those aliens are a little different from the Zonders.

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:10.620
Even if I can sense Zonders, I can't sense those Zonderians...

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:11.870
And also...

00:21:21.960 --> 00:21:23.010
Captain!

00:21:23.880 --> 00:21:25.630
Thanks, ChoRyuJin.

00:21:25.970 --> 00:21:27.680
I'm all right.

00:21:28.010 --> 00:21:29.180
But...

00:21:29.470 --> 00:21:33.520
If I make the slightest mistake with this thing there'll be serious destruction.

00:21:33.520 --> 00:21:35.890
It sure is a Hyper Tool!

00:21:37.650 --> 00:21:39.690
Curatio!

00:21:40.150 --> 00:21:43.530
Teneritas, sectio...

00:21:43.860 --> 00:21:47.570
...salus, coctura!

00:21:54.870 --> 00:21:56.500
Oh, I'm back!

00:21:59.460 --> 00:22:01.090
I've got a message from Volfogg.

00:22:01.630 --> 00:22:05.260
The man Mamoru just purified has been taken into custody.

00:22:06.510 --> 00:22:07.590
Thank goodness!

00:22:07.840 --> 00:22:12.760
But that G-Tool, there's still so much room for improvement...

00:22:14.180 --> 00:22:16.180
Gai... thank goodness!

00:22:16.480 --> 00:22:18.690
Really, I'm so glad!

00:22:19.100 --> 00:22:22.860
And so mankind was able to overcome its greatest disaster.

00:22:22.900 --> 00:22:24.230
Waha!

00:22:24.690 --> 00:22:26.490
Dad!

00:22:27.990 --> 00:22:33.030
But as for this new power of GaoGaiGar's, the Goldion Hammer...

00:22:33.200 --> 00:22:39.710
Can we be sure that it will hold the key to victory in the next battle?

00:22:46.490 --> 00:22:50.390
You come floating down onto my planet.

00:22:51.590 --> 00:22:55.260
That's the dream I always have.

00:22:56.660 --> 00:23:01.440
Now you're looking up at the sky again...

00:23:01.440 --> 00:23:06.230
and you're searching for me.

00:23:06.860 --> 00:23:10.400
Longing to see you and be with you...

00:23:11.570 --> 00:23:17.330
I know I feel it just as strongly as you.

00:23:19.390 --> 00:23:24.090
Give us the wings to fly

00:23:24.090 --> 00:23:28.750
and set off into the galaxy.

00:23:29.440 --> 00:23:34.090
When you and I are grown up...

00:23:34.090 --> 00:23:40.990
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:45.860 --> 00:23:49.190
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:49.820 --> 00:23:51.360
The school is in danger!

00:23:51.660 --> 00:23:54.700
Why was that strict Vice Principal transformed into a Zonder?

00:23:55.200 --> 00:23:57.700
Mamoru and his classmates are trapped inside the school.

00:23:57.830 --> 00:24:01.830
Unable to contact GGG, the kids must fight on against an enemy...

00:24:02.000 --> 00:24:04.290
...who has even Volfogg fooled!

00:24:04.670 --> 00:24:06.840
Next episode of GaoGaiGar, King of Braves...

00:24:06.630 --> 00:24:06.670
Zonder Teacher

00:24:06.750 --> 00:24:10.420
Zonder Teacher

00:24:06.880 --> 00:24:08.170
"Zonder Teacher"

00:24:08.210 --> 00:24:12.010
Make sure you stay tuned for the order..."Final Fusion Approved!"

00:24:12.930 --> 00:24:14.800
This is the Key to Victory!
